  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Additional contribution to the Making Every Woman and Girl Count (Women Count) programme, implemented by UN Women. The programme aims to effect a radical shift in the production, availability, accessibility and use of quality data and statistics on key aspects of gender equality and women&#x2019;s empowerment. The objectives of the grant are to: create an enabling environment for the production and use of gender data; ensure gender data gaps are filled; and ensure gender data is accessible and used to inform policy and advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
